0138:     - Also fill any framed square room of an endpoint-derived size that intersects that shortest-path mask.
0139: 
0140:     Key insight
0141:     - Shortest paths identify the route through open connector corridors, while the wall-bordered square rooms need to be expanded from the route centerline to their full interior.
